  "reason": "Select only model_design because the proposed output projection is model-owned and all host components are frozen. Shared history and target embeddings may constrain matching representations, but the current validation HR@10 of 0.665 does not establish this as the cause of remaining errors. Historical successes support small, isolated architectural changes; failed positional and depth-aggregation experiments favor preserving the current backbone while testing the projection alone.",
